# System Data Flow & Process Flowcharts

This document provides a high-level overview of the data flow and process logic for the Flight Booking System, covering Instructor management, Student activities, and the core Booking Engine.

## 1. System Data Flow Diagram (DFD - Level 1)

This diagram illustrates how data moves between stakeholders, processes, and the database.

```mermaid
graph TD
    %% Entities
    Student["Student"]
    Instructor["Instructor"]
    PayMongo["PayMongo API"]
    EmailSvc["Email Service"]
    
    %% Processes
    AuthProc["Authentication & Profile Management"]
    SectProc["Section & Activity Management"]
    BookProc["GDS Booking Engine"]
    GradProc["Automated Grading Engine"]
    
    %% Data Stores
    DB[(System Database)]
    
    %% Flows - Instructor
    Instructor -- "Login/Update Profile" --> AuthProc
    Instructor -- "Create Section/Activity" --> SectProc
    SectProc -- "Store Activity Details" --> DB
    DB -- "Submissions/Grades" --> SectProc
    SectProc -- "View Feedback" --> Instructor
    
    %% Flows - Student
    Student -- "Login/View Dashboard" --> AuthProc
    AuthProc -- "Profile Data" --> Student
    DB -- "Assigned Activities" --> Student
    Student -- "Perform Booking" --> BookProc
    BookProc -- "Search/Select Flights" --> DB
    BookProc -- "Payment Processing" --> PayMongo
    PayMongo -- "Transaction Success" --> BookProc
    
    %% Flows - System Interconnect
    BookProc -- "Create Booking & PNR" --> DB
    DB -- "Trigger Notification" --> EmailSvc
    EmailSvc -- "Send E-Ticket" --> Student
    
    %% Flows - Grading
    DB -- "Booking Data" --> GradProc
    GradProc -- "Apply Requirements Logic" --> DB
    DB -- "Update Score & Feedback" --> Student
```

---

## 2. Booking Process Flowchart

A step-by-step visualization of the Student's journey from selecting an activity to receiving an E-Ticket.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([Start]) --> Login[Student Login]
    Login --> Dashboard[View Activity Dashboard]
    Dashboard --> SelectAct[Select Activity & View Requirements]
    SelectAct --> InitBooking[Initialize Practice Booking]
    
    subgraph Booking_Engine ["GDS Booking Engine"]
        Search[Search Flights: Origin/Dest/Date] --> Select[Select Outbound & Return Schedules]
        Select --> Passenger[Enter Passenger Information]
        Passenger --> Addons[Select Add-ons: Seats, Meals, Insurance]
        Addons --> Checkout[Review Itinerary & Total fare]
        Checkout --> Payment[Payment via PayMongo]
    end
    
    Payment -- "Payment Verified" --> Finalize[Finalize Booking & Generate PNR]
    Finalize --> Ticket[Generate PDF E-Ticket]
    Ticket --> Grading[Trigger Auto-Grading Engine]
    
    subgraph Grading_Engine ["Grading & Feedback"]
        Compare[Compare Booking with Activity Requirements] --> Calculate[Calculate Score based on weights]
        Calculate --> feedback[Generate Itemized Feedback]
    end
    
    Grading --> Finish([End: View Grade & Download Ticket])
```

---

## 3. Instructor Workflow

The administrative process for managing students and curriculum tasks.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    Start([Instructor Login]) --> CreateSect[Create Section]
    CreateSect --> Enroll[Enroll Students via CSV or List]
    Enroll --> CreateAct[Create Activity/Assignment]
    
    subgraph Activity_Config ["Activity Configuration"]
        Reqs[Set Requirements: Trip Type, Route, Class, Pax Count] --> Points[Assign Total Points & Weights]
        Points --> Activate[Activate Activity for Section]
    end
    
    Activate --> Monitor[Monitor Submissions & Automated Grades]
```
